{"id":"a29561e19141b05f","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-poisson-process.md","title":"Poisson Process","display":"df-poisson-process — Poisson Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-poisson-process","aliases":["58-df-poisson-process","Poisson Process"],"display":"df-poisson-process — Poisson Process","depends_on":["[[58-df-counting-process]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-poisson-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-poisson-process</span><span>Poisson Process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-poisson-process — Poisson Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1dbfbd2016bef53d\" href=\"?note=1dbfbd2016bef53d\" title=\"58-df-counting-process\">58-df-counting-process</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (probability space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\to\\omega^\\Omega\">\\(N:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\to\\omega^\\Omega\\)</span> (counting process, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1dbfbd2016bef53d\" href=\"?note=1dbfbd2016bef53d\" title=\"58-df-counting-process\">58-df-counting-process</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span> (rate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountingProcess}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CountingProcess}_S\\)</span> (counting-process predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1dbfbd2016bef53d\" href=\"?note=1dbfbd2016bef53d\" title=\"58-df-counting-process\">58-df-counting-process</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndependentCountingIncrements}_S(N;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{IndependentCountingIncrements}_S(N;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (independent-increments predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PoissonProcess}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{PoissonProcess}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}poisson\\text{-}independent\\text{-}increments}\\vdash \\mathrm{IndependentCountingIncrements}_S(N;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall(t_i)_{i\\leq n}\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^{n+1}\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall i&lt;n\\;(t_i&lt;t_{i+1})\\right]\\to\\forall(A_i)_{i&lt;n}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^n\\;\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcap_{i&lt;n}\\{\\eta\\in\\Omega:N(t_{i+1})(\\eta)-N(t_i)(\\eta)\\in A_i\\}\\right)=\\prod_{i&lt;n}\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\{\\eta\\in\\Omega:N(t_{i+1})(\\eta)-N(t_i)(\\eta)\\in A_i\\}\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}poisson\\text{-}independent\\text{-}increments}\\vdash \\mathrm{IndependentCountingIncrements}_S(N;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall(t_i)_{i\\leq n}\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^{n+1}\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall i&lt;n\\;(t_i&lt;t_{i+1})\\right]\\to\\forall(A_i)_{i&lt;n}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^n\\;\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcap_{i&lt;n}\\{\\eta\\in\\Omega:N(t_{i+1})(\\eta)-N(t_i)(\\eta)\\in A_i\\}\\right)=\\prod_{i&lt;n}\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\{\\eta\\in\\Omega:N(t_{i+1})(\\eta)-N(t_i)(\\eta)\\in A_i\\}\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}poisson\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\operatorname{PoissonProcess}_S(N,\\lambda,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CountingProcess}_S(N,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\mathrm{IndependentCountingIncrements}_S(N;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\left(s&lt;t\\to\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\mathbb P(\\{\\eta\\in\\Omega:N(t)(\\eta)-N(s)(\\eta)=k\\})=e^{-\\lambda(t-s)}\\frac{(\\lambda(t-s))^k}{k!}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}poisson\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\operatorname{PoissonProcess}_S(N,\\lambda,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CountingProcess}_S(N,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\mathrm{IndependentCountingIncrements}_S(N;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\left(s&lt;t\\to\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\mathbb P(\\{\\eta\\in\\Omega:N(t)(\\eta)-N(s)(\\eta)=k\\})=e^{-\\lambda(t-s)}\\frac{(\\lambda(t-s))^k}{k!}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The signature now matches <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1dbfbd2016bef53d\" href=\"?note=1dbfbd2016bef53d\" title=\"58-df-counting-process\">58-df-counting-process</a> and makes the underlying probability space explicit.</li>\n<li>The increment law plus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N(0)=0\">\\(N(0)=0\\)</span> implies the marginal law <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N(t)\\sim\\operatorname{Poisson}(\\lambda t)\">\\(N(t)\\sim\\operatorname{Poisson}(\\lambda t)\\)</span>; that is a theorem-level consequence.</li>\n<li>No Markov-process dependency is needed to define a Poisson process.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kingman, Poisson Processes</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-counting-process","status":"resolved","id":"1dbfbd2016bef53d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-counting-process]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-counting-process","status":"resolved","id":"1dbfbd2016bef53d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$N:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\to\\omega^\\Omega$ (counting process, see [[58-df-counting-process]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-counting-process","status":"resolved","id":"1dbfbd2016bef53d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CountingProcess}_S$ (counting-process predicate, see [[58-df-counting-process]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-counting-process","status":"resolved","id":"1dbfbd2016bef53d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The signature now matches [[58-df-counting-process]] and makes the underlying probability space explicit.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"N:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\to\\omega^\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CountingProcess}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IndependentCountingIncrements}_S(N;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PoissonProcess}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}poisson\\text{-}independent\\text{-}increments}\\vdash \\mathrm{IndependentCountingIncrements}_S(N;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall(t_i)_{i\\leq n}\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^{n+1}\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall i<n\\;(t_i<t_{i+1})\\right]\\to\\forall(A_i)_{i<n}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^n\\;\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcap_{i<n}\\{\\eta\\in\\Omega:N(t_{i+1})(\\eta)-N(t_i)(\\eta)\\in A_i\\}\\right)=\\prod_{i<n}\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\{\\eta\\in\\Omega:N(t_{i+1})(\\eta)-N(t_i)(\\eta)\\in A_i\\}\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}poisson\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\operatorname{PoissonProcess}_S(N,\\lambda,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CountingProcess}_S(N,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\mathrm{IndependentCountingIncrements}_S(N;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\left(s<t\\to\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\mathbb P(\\{\\eta\\in\\Omega:N(t)(\\eta)-N(s)(\\eta)=k\\})=e^{-\\lambda(t-s)}\\frac{(\\lambda(t-s))^k}{k!}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"N(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"N(t)\\sim\\operatorname{Poisson}(\\lambda t)","display":false}],"bytes":2184,"backlinks":[{"id":"1dbfbd2016bef53d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"The Poisson law and independent-increment conditions belong to [[58-df-poisson-process]], avoiding a circular definition between counting and Poisson processes."},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-220","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-poisson-process]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-960","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-poisson-process.md|58-df-poisson-process]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["1dbfbd2016bef53d"]}